B.beg=new A.f7("1. Acceptance of Terms","By accessing and using the Madio Express platform, you agree to be bound by these terms of service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you may not access the service.")
B.be8=new A.f7("2. Service Description","Madio Express is an e-commerce platform that allows users to create and manage virtual stores, including product management, order processing, inventory control, and online payments.")
B.beb=new A.f7("3. User Accounts","To use the service, you must create an account by providing accurate and complete information. You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account and password. Madio Express will not be liable for losses caused by unauthorized use of your account.")
B.be1=new A.f7("4. Acceptable Use","You agree not to use the platform for illegal, fraudulent activities, or activities that violate the rights of third parties. We reserve the right to suspend or cancel accounts that violate these terms.")
B.bee=new A.f7("5. Payments and Billing","Paid plans are billed according to the selected period (monthly or annual). Transaction fees apply according to the contracted plan. The first 3 months of paid plans are free.")
B.beh=new A.f7("6. Intellectual Property","The content, design, and code of Madio Express are the property of the company. Users retain ownership of their data, products, and images uploaded to the platform.")
B.be4=new A.f7("7. Limitation of Liability",'Madio Express shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of the platform. The service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.')
B.be6=new A.f7("8. Contact","For questions about these terms, contact us via WhatsApp at +57 311 311 4315 or through our social media channels.")
